n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QlGeKnoBNDfd7MhJqweTEJzgHfXYPVjtEbmfD9LnLibsNcrRWt02BFUL4ib20yShlIS0hEmDTtAwRg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 24px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          这个批次的处理是双重的发酵方式，首先将咖啡鲜果先开放有氧环境下静置24小时，随后将其放入塑胶袋（Grainpro谷物袋）中静置90小时，这期间的环境温度维持低于22摄氏度，在这样的温度与厌氧环境下，乳酸菌可以更有利的发展进行发酵。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 24px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Mic